SUMMARY:Black Techno Matters
LOCATION:The Boombox Miami\, 4447 Southwest 75th Avenue\, Miami\, FL 33155
 \, USA
DESCRIPTION:Public Energy is proud to be partnering with Black Techno Matte
 rs hailing from Washington D.C for their 7 year anniversary. With a shared
  mission to remind the masses of where their music originates from - Publi
 c Energy invites Founder BXNRXD & 1/2 of Secret Handshake Nile Ashton to s
 how what the source really sounds like. On Local support we have PE founde
 r Duality getting out of his comfort zone pushing percussive club bangers 
 and riding rhythms to set the floor for Miami’s main stay and big brothe
 r Pressurepoint B2B Lady Narcisse. To start the night right we have Dub Te
 chno connoisseur DUUN alongside a debut for Browards KILLAJAY. To end the 
 night right for a rare set outside his domain is SERAFITZ with an all wax 
 set. We’re beyond excited to have techno bumping right here at The Boomb
 ox Miami. ALL BLACK OUTFIT IS *HIGHLY* Encouraged for the occasion.\nLineu
 p: Nile Ashton\, B_X_R_N_X_R_D\, duun\, Duality\nTickets: T1 $10\nhttps://
 shotgun.live/en/events/black-techo-matters
